. import delimited "`fz'\us_state_centroids.csv", clear varnames(1)
(encoding automatically selected: ISO-8859-1)
(9 vars, 51 obs)

. keep usps lat lon

. merge 1:1 usps using `f2u', keep(match) nogen

    Result                      Number of obs
